# 1) تحليل الكود المرجعي (ثيم سيليا) — قبل البناء

قبل كتابة أي سطر، هذه خلاصة تحليل البنية المرجعية وما سأستعيره **هندسيًا فقط**:

| العنصر | ماذا وجدت في ثيم سيليا | القرار لـ COOKIES LINO |
|---|---|---|
| **هيكل الصفحة** | `header` (شريط ترويجي + Topbar + Nav) → `main` بأقسام مرقّمة `component-id` → `footer` → طبقات عائمة (سلة، بحث، دخول، Quick View، Bottom Nav) | نفس الطبقات الوظيفية، بترتيب وتكوين بصري مختلف كليًا |
| **السلة** | Cart Drawer جانبي مع Subtotal/خصم/إجمالي + زر Checkout + كوبونات | سلة Drawer كاملة: إضافة/حذف/كمية/إجمالي + حالة فارغة + Checkout |
| **المنتجات** | `custom-salla-product-card` يستقبل JSON منتج كامل + `salla-products-slider/list` بخصائص `source` و`source-value` | نظام بطاقات خاص بالثيم + طبقة بيانات مركزية، مع إبقاء عناصر سلة جاهزة للـ Hydration |
| **التنقل** | قائمة موبايل + قوائم منسدلة سطح مكتب + Bottom Nav للجوال | الثلاثة معًا لكن بمنطق وواجهة مختلفة |
| **المكونات التفاعلية** | تبويبات منتجات، عدّاد تنازلي، سلايدرات، Marquee، أسئلة شائعة، آراء عملاء، نشرة بريدية، فروع | أبقيت كل الوظائف وأعدت تصميمها لسياق المخبز |
| **الوضع الليلي/اللغة/العملة** | تبديل ثيم + Localization Modal | تبديل ثيم + تبديل عربي/إنجليزي فعلي (RTL↔LTR) |
| **منطق قابل لإعادة الاستخدام** | Lazy loading، أحداث `salla.event.dispatch`، حالة السلة، السلايدرات، الـ Popups | أُعيد بناؤها Vanilla JS نظيفة بدون أي نسخة بصرية |

> ⚠️ لم أنسخ أي لون أو تكوين أو هوية أو منتجات من سيليا — المرجع كان **الهندسة فقط**.

---

# 2) الثيم الكامل — COOKIES LINO

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>كوكيز لينو | COOKIES LINO — كوكيز فاخر مخبوز يوميًا</title>
<meta name="description" content="كوكيز لينو — كوكيز حرفي فاخر بشوكولاتة حقيقية، مخبوز يوميًا. بوكسات هدايا، كوكيز محشي، وكلاسيكيات لا تُقاوم.">

<!--
  ============================================================
  COOKIES LINO — Premium Cookie Boutique Theme (Salla-Ready)
  ============================================================
  ملاحظات النشر داخل منصة سلة:
  1) عناصر <salla-*> المضمّنة تُروى تلقائيًا داخل بيئة سلة
     (السلة، البحث، الدخول، تعريب العملة/اللغة).
  2) في الإنتاج: استبدل مصفوفة LINO_PRODUCTS بمخرجات Twig
     الخاصة بالمنتجات، وروابط LINO_ASSETS بروابط CDN سلة.
  3) كل الصور مركزية في كائن LINO_ASSETS أعلى السكربت.
  ============================================================
-->

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Almarai:wght@300;400;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
/* ============================================================
   1) DESIGN TOKENS — COOKIES LINO
============================================================ */
:root{
  /* Brand palette */
  --choco:        #3B2314;
  --choco-deep:   #241207;
  --choco-soft:   #6B4A32;
  --cream:        #F2E4C8;
  --cream-bright: #FBF5E8;
  --paper:        #FFFDF8;
  --terra:        #B4552D;
  --terra-deep:   #8F3E1D;
  --butter:       #E9B44C;
  --leaf:         #5F7A4E;
  --danger:       #C0392B;

  /* Semantic */
  --bg:        var(--paper);
  --bg-soft:   var(--cream-bright);
  --bg-card:   #FFFFFF;
  --ink:       var(--choco);
  --ink-soft:  #7A6248;
  --line:      #EADFC8;
  --accent:    var(--terra);

  /* Type */
  --font-ar: 'Almarai', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-en: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  /* Shape & depth */
  --r-sm: 10px; --r-md: 16px; --r-lg: 24px; --r-xl: 32px;
  --arch: 46% 46% 18px 18px / 38% 38% 18px 18px;
  --shadow-sm: 0 2px 10px rgba(59,35,20,.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 10px 30px rgba(59,35,20,.10);
  --shadow-lg: 0 24px 60px rgba(59,35,20,.16);

  /* Layout */
  --container: 1240px;
  --header-h: 76px;
  --ease: cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);
}

[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:        #191009;
  --bg-soft:   #211509;
  --bg-card:   #241811;
  --ink:       #F5E9D2;
  --ink-soft:  #C8B190;
  --line:      #3B2A1B;
  --cream:     #2C1D10;
  --cream-bright:#221609;
  --shadow-sm: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  --shadow-md: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  --shadow-lg: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
}

/* ============================================================
   2) BASE / RESET
============================================================ */
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{
  font-family:var(--font-ar);
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.7;
  font-size:16px;
  overflow-x:hidden;
  transition:background .4s var(--ease), color .4s var(--ease);
}
img{display:block;max-width:100%}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;color:inherit}
input,textarea,select{font-family:inherit;font-size:1rem}
ul,ol{list-style:none}
::selection{background:var(--terra);color:#fff}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--terra);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}

.container{width:min(var(--container), 100% - 2.5rem);margin-inline:auto}
.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}

.skip-link{
  position:fixed;inset-block-start:.75rem;inset-inline-start:.75rem;z-index:99999;
  background:var(--choco);color:#fff;padding:.7rem 1.3rem;border-radius:var(--r-md);
  transform:translateY(-250%);transition:transform .3s;
}
.skip-link:focus{transform:none}

/* Typography scale */
h1,h2,h3,h4{line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0}
.t-kicker{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;
  color:var(--terra);font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;
}
.t-kicker::before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:currentColor;border-radius:2px}
.t-display{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4.2vw,3.3rem)}
.t-section{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2.3rem)}
.t-caption{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.latin-logo{font-family:var(--font-en);letter-spacing:.06em}

/* Section shell */
.section{padding-block:clamp(3.2rem,7vw,5.5rem)}
.section-head{margin-block-end:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.6rem)}
.section-head--center{text-align:center}
.section-head--center .t-kicker{justify-content:center}
.section-head--center .t-kicker::before{display:none}
.section-sub{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:56ch;margin-block-start:.6rem}
.section-head--center .section-sub{margin-inline:auto}

/* ============================================================
   3) BUTTONS / CHIPS / BADGES
============================================================ */
.btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.55rem;
  font-weight:800;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1;
  padding:.95rem 1.7rem;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid transparent;
  transition:transform .25s var(--ease), box-shadow .25s, background .25s, color .25s;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.btn--primary{background:var(--terra);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(180,85,45,.28)}
.btn--primary:hover{background:var(--terra-deep);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn--dark{background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream-bright)}
.btn--dark:hover{background:var(--choco-deep);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn--ghost{border-color:var(--choco);color:var(--ink)}
.btn--ghost:hover{background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream-bright)}
.btn--cream{background:var(--cream);color:var(--choco)}
.btn--cream:hover{background:#fff}
.btn--block{width:100%}
.btn--sm{padding:.65rem 1.15rem;font-size:.85rem}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}

.chip{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;
  padding:.35rem .85rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;
  background:var(--cream);color:var(--choco);
}
.chip--terra{background:var(--terra);color:#fff}
.chip--line{background:transparent;border:1.5px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink-soft)}

.badge{
  position:absolute;inset-block-start:.8rem;inset-inline-start:.8rem;z-index:2;
  padding:.32rem .8rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff;
}
.badge--best{background:var(--choco)}
.badge--new{background:var(--leaf)}
.badge--limited{background:var(--butter);color:var(--choco)}
.badge--sale{background:var(--terra)}

.icon-btn{
  position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;color:var(--ink);
  transition:background .25s, color .25s, transform .25s;
}
.icon-btn:hover{background:var(--cream);color:var(--terra)}
.icon-btn svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.icon-btn .count{
  position:absolute;inset-block-start:2px;inset-inline-end:0;
  min-width:18px;height:18px;padding-inline:4px;border-radius:999px;
  background:var(--terra);color:#fff;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;
  display:grid;place-items:center;pointer-events:none;
}
.icon-btn .count:empty{display:none}

/* ============================================================
   4) LOADING OVERLAY
============================================================ */
.lino-loading{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;display:grid;place-items:center;
  background:var(--bg);transition:opacity .5s var(--ease);
}
.lino-loading.is-done{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.lino-loading__cookie{font-size:3.4rem;animation:linoBounce 1.4s ease-in-out infinite}
.lino-loading__txt{margin-block-start:.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--terra)}
@keyframes linoBounce{0%,100%{transform:scale(.85) rotate(-6deg)}50%{transform:scale(1.12) rotate(6deg)}}

/* ============================================================
   5) ANNOUNCEMENT MARQUEE
============================================================ */
.annc{background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream);overflow:hidden;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700}
.annc__track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:linoMarquee 28s linear infinite}
.annc__group{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2.6rem;padding:.55rem 1.3rem;white-space:nowrap}
.annc__group span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem}
.annc__group i{font-style:normal;color:var(--butter)}
@keyframes linoMarquee{to{transform:translateX(50%)}}
[dir="ltr"] .annc__track{animation-name:linoMarqueeLtr}
@keyframes linoMarqueeLtr{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* ============================================================
   6) HEADER
============================================================ */
.site-header{
  position:sticky;inset-block-start:0;z-index:900;
  background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, transparent);
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-block-end:1px solid transparent;
  transition:border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s, background .3s;
}
.site-header.is-stuck{border-block-end-color:var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}

.header-top{
  display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;
  border-block-end:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
}
.header-top .container{padding-block:.45rem}
.header-top__msg{display:inline-flex;gap:.45rem;align-items:center;font-weight:700}
.ht-actions{display:flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:center}
.ht-btn{
  display:inline-flex;gap:.35rem;align-items:center;padding:.3rem .7rem;
  border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;border:1px solid var(--line);
  transition:border-color .2s,color .2s;
}
.ht-btn:hover{border-color:var(--terra);color:var(--terra)}
@media(min-width:900px){.header-top{display:block}}

.header-main{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;min-height:var(--header-h)}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;margin-inline-end:auto}
.brand__mark{width:46px;height:46px;flex:none}
.brand__name{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.15}
.brand__name b{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800}
.brand__name span{font-family:var(--font-en);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.34em;color:var(--terra);font-weight:700}

.main-nav{display:none}
.main-nav ul{display:flex;gap:.2rem}
.main-nav a,.main-nav .nav-parent{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem;padding:.6rem .9rem;
  font-weight:800;font-size:.92rem;border-radius:999px;color:var(--ink);
  transition:color .2s, background .2s;
}
.main-nav a:hover,.nav-item:hover > .nav-parent{color:var(--terra);background:var(--cream)}
.nav-item{position:relative}
.nav-caret{width:14px;height:14px;transition:transform .25s}
.nav-item:hover .nav-caret{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.nav-drop{
  position:absolute;inset-block-start:calc(100% + 10px);inset-inline-start:0;
  min-width:230px;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:var(--r-md);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);padding:.6rem;
  opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(10px);
  transition:opacity .25s var(--ease), transform .25s var(--ease), visibility .25s;
}
.nav-item:hover .nav-drop,.nav-item:focus-within .nav-drop{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}
.nav-drop a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-radius:var(--r-sm);width:100%}
.nav-drop a small{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:400}
@media(min-width:1024px){.main-nav{display:block;margin-inline-end:auto}}

.header-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.15rem}

/* ============================================================
   7) MOBILE MENU DRAWER
============================================================ */
.scrim{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:950;background:rgba(36,18,7,.5);
  backdrop-filter:blur(3px);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:.35s;
}
.scrim.is-open{opacity:1;visibility:visible}

.m-menu{
  position:fixed;inset-block:0;inset-inline-start:0;z-index:960;
  width:min(340px,88vw);background:var(--bg);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  transform:translateX(-105%);transition:transform .4s var(--ease);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
}
[dir="ltr"] .m-menu{transform:translateX(-105%)}
[dir="rtl"] .m-menu{transform:translateX(105%)}
.m-menu.is-open{transform:none}
.m-menu__head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.2rem;border-block-end:1px solid var(--line)}
.m-menu__body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:1rem 1.2rem}
.m-menu__foot{padding:1rem 1.2rem;border-block-start:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;gap:.6rem}

.m-link{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:.85rem .4rem;font-weight:800;border-block-end:1px dashed var(--line);
  width:100%;text-align:start;
}
.m-sub{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s var(--ease)}
.m-sub.is-open{max-height:400px}
.m-sub a{display:block;padding:.6rem .9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem}
.m-sub a:hover{color:var(--terra)}

/* ============================================================
   8) HERO — Editorial split
============================================================ */
.hero{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 12% 20%, rgba(180,85,45,.10), transparent 42%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 88% 78%, rgba(233,180,76,.16), transparent 46%),
    var(--bg-soft);
}
.hero::before{ /* cookie-crumbs dots */
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.35;
  background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(59,35,20,.14) 1.3px, transparent 1.3px);
  background-size:26px 26px;
  mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #000 22%, #000 78%, transparent);
}
.hero__grid{
  position:relative;display:grid;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;
  padding-block:clamp(3rem,8vw,5.5rem);
}
@media(min-width:960px){.hero__grid{grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;gap:3.5rem}}

.hero__kicker{margin-block-end:1.1rem}
.hero__title{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,5.4vw,3.7rem);font-weight:800;margin-block-end:1.1rem}
.hero__title em{font-style:normal;color:var(--terra);position:relative;white-space:nowrap}
.hero__title em::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset-inline:0;inset-block-end:.08em;height:.32em;
  background:var(--cream);z-index:-1;border-radius:4px;
}
.hero__lead{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:52ch;font-size:1.05rem;margin-block-end:1.8rem}
.hero__cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.9rem;margin-block-end:2rem}
.hero__trust{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero__stars{color:var(--butter);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:.95rem}
.hero__trust small{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700}

.hero__media{position:relative;justify-self:center;width:min(470px,100%)}
.hero__img{
  width:100%;aspect-ratio:.86;object-fit:cover;
  border-radius:var(--arch);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
  border:6px solid #fff;
}
.hero__float{
  position:absolute;inset-block-end:6%;inset-inline-start:-4%;
  background:var(--bg-card);border-radius:var(--r-lg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
  display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;padding:.7rem .9rem;width:min(240px,70%);
  animation:linoFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.hero__float img{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:var(--r-sm);object-fit:cover}
.hero__float b{display:block;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.3}
.hero__float small{color:var(--terra);font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem}
.hero__stamp{
  position:absolute;inset-block-start:4%;inset-inline-end:-3%;
  width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream);
  display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.4;
  padding:.6rem;transform:rotate(10deg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
  animation:linoSpin 16s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes linoFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-12px)}}
@keyframes linoSpin{to{transform:rotate(370deg)}}

/* ============================================================
   9) VALUES STRIP (second marquee)
============================================================ */
.values{background:var(--terra);color:#fff;overflow:hidden}
.values .annc__track{animation-duration:34s}
.values .annc__group{gap:3rem;font-size:.9rem;padding:.8rem 1.3rem}
.values i{color:var(--cream)}

/* ============================================================
   10) CATEGORIES
============================================================ */
.cats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1rem}
@media(min-width:640px){.cats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:1100px){.cats{grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr)}}
.cat{
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;
  padding:1.15rem .8rem;border-radius:var(--r-lg);
  background:var(--bg-card);border:1.5px solid var(--line);
  transition:transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s, border-color .3s;
  text-align:center;
}
.cat:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);border-color:var(--terra)}
.cat__img{width:86px;height:86px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--cream)}
.cat__name{font-weight:800;font-size:.92rem}
.cat__sub{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-block-start:-.5rem}

/* ============================================================
   11) PRODUCT CARD
============================================================ */
.p-grid{display:grid;gap:1.2rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(215px,1fr))}
@media(max-width:480px){.p-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:.8rem}}

.pcard{
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;
  background:var(--bg-card);border-radius:var(--r-lg);border:1.5px solid var(--line);
  transition:transform .35s var(--ease), box-shadow .35s, border-color .35s;
}
.pcard:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);border-color:transparent}
.pcard__media{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1.05;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)}
.pcard__media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .6s var(--ease)}
.pcard:hover .pcard__media img{transform:scale(1.07)}
.pcard__wish{
  position:absolute;inset-block-start:.8rem;inset-inline-end:.8rem;z-index:2;
  width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:color-mix(in srgb,#fff 85%,transparent);
  display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--choco);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
  transition:transform .25s, color .25s, background .25s;
}
.pcard__wish:hover{transform:scale(1.12)}
.pcard__wish.is-on{color:#fff;background:var(--terra)}
.pcard__wish svg{width:18px;height:18px}
.pcard__hover{
  position:absolute;inset-inline:0;inset-block-end:0;z-index:2;
  padding:.7rem;display:flex;gap:.5rem;justify-content:center;
  background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(36,18,7,.62), transparent);
  transform:translateY(110%);transition:transform .35s var(--ease);
}
.pcard:hover .pcard__hover,.pcard:focus-within .pcard__hover{transform:none}
.pcard__hover button{
  padding:.55rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;
  background:#fff;color:var(--choco);transition:background .2s,color .2s;
}
.pcard__hover button:hover{background:var(--terra);color:#fff}

.pcard__body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem;padding:1rem;flex:1}
.pcard__rate{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.pcard__rate .stars{color:var(--butter);letter-spacing:1px}
.pcard__name{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.45}
.pcard__name a:hover{color:var(--terra)}
.pcard__price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.5rem;margin-block-start:auto;padding-block-start:.4rem}
.pcard__price b{font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--terra)}
.pcard__price s{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.pcard__price .off{
  font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--cream);color:var(--terra);
  padding:.15rem .5rem;border-radius:999px;
}
.pcard__add{
  margin-block-start:.7rem;width:100%;padding:.75rem;border-radius:var(--r-md);
  background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream-bright);font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;
  transition:background .25s, transform .2s;
}
.pcard__add:hover{background:var(--terra)}
.pcard__add svg{width:16px;height:16px}

.grid-empty{
  grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
  border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);font-weight:700;
}

/* ============================================================
   12) SCROLL SLIDER (generic)
============================================================ */
.lslider{position:relative}
.lslider__viewport{
  display:flex;gap:1.2rem;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;
  padding-block-end:.8rem;scrollbar-width:none;
}
.lslider__viewport::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.lslider__viewport > *{flex:0 0 min(260px,78vw);scroll-snap-align:start}
.lslider__nav{display:flex;gap:.6rem;justify-content:flex-end;margin-block-end:1rem}
.lslider__btn{
  width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);
  display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg-card);color:var(--ink);
  transition:background .25s,color .25s,border-color .25s,opacity .25s;
}
.lslider__btn svg{width:18px;height:18px}
.lslider__btn:hover{background:var(--terra);border-color:var(--terra);color:#fff}
.lslider__btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}

/* ============================================================
   13) EDITORIAL COLLECTION
============================================================ */
.coll{display:grid;gap:1.1rem;grid-template-columns:1fr}
@media(min-width:820px){
  .coll{grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);grid-auto-rows:230px}
  .coll__tile--a{grid-column:span 5;grid-row:span 2}
  .coll__tile--b{grid-column:span 4}
  .coll__tile--c{grid-column:span 3}
  .coll__tile--d{grid-column:span 7}
}
.coll__tile{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--r-xl);
  display:flex;align-items:flex-end;min-height:230px;
  transition:transform .35s var(--ease);
}
.coll__tile:hover{transform:scale(.99)}
.coll__tile img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .7s var(--ease)}
.coll__tile:hover img{transform:scale(1.06)}
.coll__tile::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(36,18,7,.78) 0%, rgba(36,18,7,.15) 45%, transparent 70%)}
.coll__cap{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:1.4rem;color:#fff;width:100%}
.coll__cap h3{font-size:1.2rem;margin-block-end:.2rem}
.coll__cap p{font-size:.82rem;opacity:.85;margin-block-end:.7rem}
.coll__link{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem;
  color:var(--cream);border-block-end:2px solid var(--terra);padding-block-end:.15rem;
}
.coll__link svg{width:15px;height:15px;transition:transform .25s}
.coll__tile:hover .coll__link svg{transform:translateX(-4px)}
[dir="ltr"] .coll__tile:hover .coll__link svg{transform:translateX(4px)}
.coll__tag{
  position:absolute;z-index:2;inset-block-start:1rem;inset-inline-start:1rem;
  background:var(--cream);color:var(--choco);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;
  padding:.35rem .8rem;border-radius:999px;
}

/* ============================================================
   14) STORY
============================================================ */
.story{background:var(--bg-soft)}
.story__grid{display:grid;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center}
@media(min-width:960px){.story__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:4rem}}
.story__media{position:relative;width:min(440px,100%);justify-self:center}
.story__img{border-radius:var(--r-xl);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);aspect-ratio:.92;object-fit:cover;width:100%}
.story__frame{
  position:absolute;inset:-14px;border:2px dashed var(--terra);border-radius:calc(var(--r-xl) + 10px);
  inset-inline-start:-14px;opacity:.5;pointer-events:none;
}
.story__badge{
  position:absolute;inset-block-end:-16px;inset-inline-end:-10px;
  background:var(--terra);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--r-lg);
  padding:.8rem 1.2rem;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
  display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;
}
.story__list{display:grid;gap:.8rem;margin-block:1.5rem}
.story__list li{display:flex;gap:.7rem;align-items:flex-start;font-weight:700}
.story__list li svg{width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--leaf);flex:none;margin-block-start:.3rem}
.story__list small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.story__stats{display:flex;gap:2.2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-block-start:1.8rem;padding-block-start:1.6rem;border-block-start:1px dashed var(--line)}
.story__stats b{display:block;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--terra);font-weight:800}
.story__stats span{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700}

/* ============================================================
   15) TABS
============================================================ */
.tabs__bar{display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-block-end:2rem}
.tab-btn{
  padding:.7rem 1.4rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:.9rem;
  border:1.5px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink-soft);background:var(--bg-card);
  transition:all .25s var(--ease);
}
.tab-btn:hover{border-color:var(--terra);color:var(--terra)}
.tab-btn.is-active{background:var(--choco);border-color:var(--choco);color:var(--cream-bright)}
.tab-panel{display:none}
.tab-panel.is-active{display:block;animation:linoFadeUp .5s var(--ease)}
@keyframes linoFadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* ============================================================
   16) GIFT BOXES
============================================================ */
.gifts{background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream-bright);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.gifts::before{
  content:"🍪";position:absolute;font-size:16rem;opacity:.05;
  inset-block-end:-4rem;inset-inline-end:-3rem;transform:rotate(-15deg);pointer-events:none;
}
.gifts .t-kicker{color:var(--butter)}
.gifts .section-sub{color:#D8C3A5}
.gift-grid{display:grid;gap:1.4rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr))}
.gift-card{
  background:#4A2E1B;border-radius:var(--r-xl);overflow:hidden;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .35s var(--ease), box-shadow .35s;
  border:1px solid rgba(242,228,200,.12);
}
.gift-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.gift-card__img{aspect-ratio:1/.8;object-fit:cover;width:100%}
.gift-card__body{padding:1.3rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.4rem;flex:1}
.gift-card__meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:.75rem;color:#D8C3A5;font-weight:700}
.gift-card h3{font-size:1.05rem}
.gift-card__price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.5rem;margin-block-start:auto;padding-block-start:.6rem}
.gift-card__price b{font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--butter)}
.gift-card__price s{font-size:.8rem;opacity:.6}
.gift-card .btn{margin-block-start:.9rem}
.gifts__cta{
  margin-block-start:2.6rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:rgba(242,228,200,.07);border:1px dashed rgba(242,228,200,.3);
  border-radius:var(--r-xl);padding:1.6rem;text-align:center;
}
.gifts__cta p{font-weight:800}
.gifts__cta small{display:block;color:#D8C3A5;font-weight:400}

/* ============================================================
   17) OFFER COUNTDOWN
============================================================ */
.offer{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(233,180,76,.25), transparent 40%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 90%, rgba(180,85,45,.3), transparent 45%),
    var(--terra-deep);
  color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:var(--r-xl);
  padding:clamp(2.2rem,6vw,4rem) 1.4rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.offer::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.12;pointer-events:none;
  background-image:radial-gradient(#fff 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);background-size:22px 22px;
}
.offer h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.4vw,2.4rem);margin-block:.8rem}
.offer__sub{opacity:.9;max-width:48ch;margin-inline:auto}
.cd{display:flex;gap:.7rem;justify-content:center;margin-block:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cd__cell{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
  border-radius:var(--r-md);min-width:78px;padding:.8rem .5rem;
  backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
}
.cd__num{display:block;font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.cd__lbl{font-size:.7rem;opacity:.85;font-weight:700}
.offer .btn--cream:hover{background:var(--choco);color:#fff}

/* ============================================================
   18) REVIEWS
============================================================ */
.rcard{
  background:var(--bg-card);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);
  padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;height:100%;
  transition:transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s;
}
.rcard:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.rcard__stars{color:var(--butter);letter-spacing:2px}
.rcard__txt{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink);flex:1}
.rcard__who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;border-block-start:1px dashed var(--line);padding-block-start:1rem}
.rcard__avatar{
  width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;
  font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--choco);flex:none;
}
.rcard__who b{display:block;font-size:.88rem}
.rcard__who small{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.74rem}
.rcard__quote{margin-inline-start:auto;color:var(--cream);font-size:2rem;line-height:1}

/* ============================================================
   19) INSTAGRAM GRID
============================================================ */
.ig-grid{display:grid;gap:.7rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
@media(min-width:760px){.ig-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr)}}
.ig-tile{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--r-md);aspect-ratio:1;display:block}
.ig-tile img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .6s var(--ease)}
.ig-tile::after{
  content:"♥";position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;
  background:rgba(59,35,20,.55);color:#fff;font-size:1.5rem;
  opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s;
}
.ig-tile:hover img{transform:scale(1.1)}
.ig-tile:hover::after{opacity:1}

/* ============================================================
   20) FAQ
============================================================ */
.faq{display:grid;gap:.8rem;max-width:820px;margin-inline:auto}
.faq__item{border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-md);background:var(--bg-card);overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .3s}
.faq__item.is-open{border-color:var(--terra)}
.faq__q{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;
  width:100%;padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;font-weight:800;text-align:start;font-size:.95rem;
}
.faq__q svg{width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--terra);flex:none;transition:transform .35s var(--ease)}
.faq__item.is-open .faq__q svg{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq__a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .45s var(--ease)}
.faq__a p{padding:0 1.3rem 1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.9}

/* ============================================================
   21) NEWSLETTER + FOOTER
============================================================ */
.nl{background:var(--cream)}
[data-theme="dark"] .nl{background:var(--bg-soft)}
.nl__inner{
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.6rem;
  background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream-bright);border-radius:var(--r-xl);
  padding:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.8rem);position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.nl__inner::before{content:"🍪";position:absolute;font-size:9rem;opacity:.08;inset-block-start:-2.5rem;inset-inline-start:-1.5rem;transform:rotate(15deg)}
.nl__inner h2{font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.6vw,1.7rem);margin-block-end:.3rem}
.nl__inner p{font-size:.85rem;opacity:.8}
.nl__form{display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;flex:1;max-width:480px;position:relative;z-index:1}
.nl__input{
  flex:1;min-width:210px;padding:.9rem 1.2rem;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid transparent;
  background:var(--cream-bright);color:var(--choco);transition:border-color .25s;
}
.nl__input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--terra)}
.nl__msg{width:100%;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;min-height:1.2em}
.nl__msg--ok{color:#9FD8A4}
.nl__msg--err{color:#FFB4A8}

.site-footer{background:var(--choco-deep);color:#D8C3A5;padding-block-start:3.5rem;font-size:.9rem}
.footer-grid{display:grid;gap:2.4rem;padding-block-end:2.8rem}
@media(min-width:900px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr}}
.footer-col h3{color:#fff;font-size:1rem;margin-block-end:1rem}
.footer-col ul{display:grid;gap:.55rem}
.footer-col a{transition:color .2s;display:inline-flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:center}
.footer-col a:hover{color:var(--butter)}
.footer-brand p{line-height:1.9;margin-block:1rem;font-size:.85rem}
.footer-social{display:flex;gap:.6rem}
.footer-social a{
  width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;
  border:1px solid rgba(242,228,200,.25);transition:all .25s;
}
.footer-social a:hover{background:var(--terra);border-color:var(--terra);color:#fff;transform:translateY(-3px)}
.footer-social svg{width:17px;height:17px}
.footer-contact li{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:flex-start}
.footer-contact svg{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;margin-block-start:.35rem;color:var(--butter)}
.footer-bottom{
  border-block-start:1px solid rgba(242,228,200,.12);
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding-block:1.3rem;font-size:.78rem;
}
.pay-badges{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pay-badge{
  border:1px solid rgba(242,228,200,.25);border-radius:6px;padding:.28rem .65rem;
  font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;color:#F2E4C8;
}

/* ============================================================
   22) BOTTOM MOBILE NAV
============================================================ */
.bnav{
  position:fixed;inset-inline:0;inset-block-end:0;z-index:940;
  background:var(--choco);display:flex;justify-content:space-around;
  padding-block:.5rem;padding-block-end:calc(.5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  box-shadow:0 -8px 30px rgba(36,18,7,.25);
}
.bnav button,.bnav a{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.2rem;
  color:#D8C3A5;font-size:.62rem;font-weight:800;min-width:60px;padding:.2rem;
  transition:color .2s,transform .2s;position:relative;
}
.bnav .is-active,.bnav button:hover{color:var(--butter);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.bnav svg{width:21px;height:21px}
.bnav .count{
  position:absolute;inset-block-start:-2px;inset-inline-end:8px;
  background:var(--terra);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-size:.58rem;
  min-width:16px;height:16px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding-inline:3px;
}
.bnav .count:empty{display:none}
@media(min-width:900px){.bnav{display:none}}
@media(max-width:899.98px){body{padding-block-end:70px}}

/* ============================================================
   23) DRAWERS / MODALS / OVERLAYS
============================================================ */
.drawer{
  position:fixed;inset-block:0;inset-inline-end:0;z-index:970;
  width:min(430px,94vw);background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  transform:translateX(105%);transition:transform .45s var(--ease);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
}
[dir="ltr"] .drawer{transform:translateX(105%)}
[dir="rtl"] .drawer{transform:translateX(-105%)}
.drawer.is-open{transform:none}
.drawer__head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;border-block-end:1px solid var(--line)}
.drawer__head h2{font-size:1.1rem;display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}
.drawer__body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:1.1rem 1.3rem}
.drawer__foot{border-block-start:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;display:grid;gap:.7rem;background:var(--bg-soft)}

.ci{display:flex;gap:.9rem;padding-block:1rem;border-block-end:1px dashed var(--line)}
.ci img{width:74px;height:74px;border-radius:var(--r-md);object-fit:cover;flex:none}
.ci__info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.ci__info b{font-size:.88rem;display:block;line-height:1.4}
.ci__price{color:var(--terra);font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem}
.ci__qty{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:.15rem .5rem;margin-block-start:.5rem}
.ci__qty button{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;transition:background .2s,color .2s}
.ci__qty button:hover{background:var(--terra);color:#fff}
.ci__qty span{min-width:20px;text-align:center;font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem}
.ci__rm{align-self:flex-start;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:.3rem;transition:color .2s}
.ci__rm:hover{color:var(--danger)}
.ci__rm svg{width:17px;height:17px}

.cart-sum{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700}
.cart-sum--total{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;border-block-start:1px dashed var(--line);padding-block-start:.7rem}
.cart-note{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center}
.cart-empty{text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.cart-empty span{font-size:3rem;display:block;margin-block-end:.8rem}

.modal-scrim{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:980;background:rgba(36,18,7,.55);
  backdrop-filter:blur(4px);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:1rem;
  opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:.35s;
}
.modal-scrim.is-open{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
.qv{
  width:min(860px,100%);background:var(--bg);border-radius:var(--r-xl);
  overflow:hidden;transform:translateY(24px) scale(.97);transition:transform .35s var(--ease);
  max-height:92vh;overflow-y:auto;
}
.modal-scrim.is-open .qv{transform:none}
.qv__grid{display:grid}
@media(min-width:760px){.qv__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.05fr}}
.qv__media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;min-height:280px}
.qv__body{padding:1.8rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem;position:relative}
.qv__close{
  position:absolute;inset-block-start:1rem;inset-inline-end:1rem;
  width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cream);
  display:grid;place-items:center;transition:background .2s,color .2s;
}
.qv__close:hover{background:var(--terra);color:#fff}
.qv__close svg{width:16px;height:16px}
.qv__price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.6rem}
.qv__price b{font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--terra)}
.qv__price s{color:var(--ink-soft)}
.qv__desc{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.9}
.qv__row{display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;margin-block-start:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.qv__qty{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:.45rem .9rem}
.qv__qty button{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;font-weight:800;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:background .2s,color .2s}
.qv__qty button:hover{background:var(--terra);color:#fff}
.qv__qty span{font-weight:800;min-width:24px;text-align:center}
.qv__meta{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700;margin-block-start:.4rem}
.qv__meta span{display:inline-flex;gap:.35rem;align-items:center}
.qv__meta svg{width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--leaf)}

/* Search overlay */
.search-ov{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:985;background:var(--bg);
  transform:translateY(-100%);transition:transform .45s var(--ease);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}
.search-ov.is-open{transform:none}
.search-ov__head{display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:center;padding:1.2rem;width:min(760px,100% - 2rem);margin-inline:auto}
.search-ov__input{
  flex:1;border:0;border-block-end:2px solid var(--line);background:transparent;
  padding:.8rem .2rem;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--ink);
}
.search-ov__input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--terra)}
.search-ov__body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:1rem;width:min(760px,100% - 2rem);margin-inline:auto}
.sr-item{display:flex;gap:.9rem;align-items:center;padding:.7rem;border-radius:var(--r-md);transition:background .2s;cursor:pointer}
.sr-item:hover{background:var(--bg-soft)}
.sr-item img{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:var(--r-sm);object-fit:cover}
.sr-item b{font-size:.88rem;display:block}
.sr-item small{color:var(--terra);font-weight:800}

/* Toast */
.toasts{position:fixed;inset-block-end:90px;inset-inline-start:1rem;z-index:9900;display:grid;gap:.6rem}
@media(min-width:900px){.toasts{inset-block-end:1.5rem}}
.toast{
  background:var(--choco);color:var(--cream-bright);padding:.85rem 1.3rem;
  border-radius:var(--r-md);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:800;
  display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;max-width:320px;
  animation:linoToastIn .4s var(--ease);
}
.toast--ok{border-inline-start:4px solid var(--leaf)}
.toast--err{border-inline-start:4px solid var(--danger)}
@keyframes linoToastIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* Floating actions */
.fab-col{position:fixed;inset-block-end:94px;inset-inline-end:1rem;z-index:930;display:grid;gap:.7rem}
@media(min-width:900px){.fab-col{inset-block-end:1.5rem}}
.fab{
  width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);transition:transform .25s var(--ease), opacity .3s;
}
.fab:hover{transform:translateY(-4px) scale(1.05)}
.fab svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.fab--wa{background:#22c55e}
.fab--top{background:var(--choco);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none}
.fab--top.is-visible{opacity:1;visibility:visible;pointer-events:auto}

/* ============================================================
   24) UTILITIES / MOTION SAFETY
============================================================ */
[data-lz]{background:var(--bg-soft)}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s var(--ease),transform .7s var(--ease)}
.reveal.is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms !important;animation-iteration-count:1 !important;transition-duration:.01ms !important;scroll-behavior:auto !important}
  .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
}
salla-search:not(:defined),salla-login-modal:not(:defined),
salla-localization-modal:not(:defined),salla-offer-modal:not(:defined){display:none}
</style>
</head>

